The image is a list of 1, 1, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, and 0.
The answers is an empty list of text.
For every row from 0 to 2.
The line is empty text.
Place "[" into line.
For every column from 0 to 2.
The mirror is 2 minus column.
The value is item (row times 3 plus mirror) of image.
The flipped is 1 minus value.
The piece is format whole number flipped as text.
If column is more than 0, Place "," into line.
Place piece into line.
If column is 2, Place "]" into line.
If column is 2, The copy is a copy of line, Place copy into answers.

For each answer in answers, show answer.
